OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785250097
OL,3,CTitanic letter sells for record
OL,4,C#60,000 at auction
OL,6,FA letter written by a passenger days
OL,7,Fbefore he died in the Titanic disaster
OL,8,Fhas sold for a record #60,000 at
OL,9,Fauction.
OL,11,FHenry Price Hodges boarded the Titanic
OL,12,Fat Southampton as a second-class
OL,13,Fpassenger and held ticket number
OL,14,F250643, which had cost #13.
OL,16,FMr Hodges wrote the letter to a
OL,17,Ffriend, Hector Young, of the Newtown
OL,18,FConservative Association in
OL,19,FSouthampton.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
