OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785250097
OL,3,CTitanic letter sells for record
OL,4,C#60,000 at auction
OL,6,FThe note was originally sewn into his
OL,7,Fwaistcoat.
OL,9,FMr Aldridge said it was another record
OL,10,Fprice, and almost quadrupled its
OL,11,Festimate.
OL,13,FThe men both died in the sinking on
OL,14,FApril 15 1912, a tragedy that claimed
OL,15,F1,500 lives.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/7
